<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">When an access token expires</h2>

<p class="govuk-body">
When an access token has expired you will be unable to access the API.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
You will need to get a new access token by following the authorisation process again to obtain a new one.
</p>

